WEBVTT

00:00:05.627 --> 00:00:07.716
[ CLICKING CONTINUES ]

00:00:12.156 --> 00:00:14.332
THANK YOU, ALBERT.

00:00:16.812 --> 00:00:18.945
MARY ELIZABETH CATTERMOLE?

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:22.992
YES.

00:00:23.036 --> 00:00:26.126
A WAND WAS TAKEN FROM YOU
UPON YOUR ARRIVAL

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:29.086
AT THE MINISTRY TODAY,
MRS. CATTERMOLE.

00:00:29.129 --> 00:00:30.478
IS THIS THAT WAND?

00:00:30.522 --> 00:00:34.134
WOULD YOU PLEASE
TELL THE COURT

00:00:34.178 --> 00:00:36.441
[Muffled] FROM WHICH WITCH
OR WIZARD YOU TOOK THIS WAND?

00:00:36.484 --> 00:00:40.053
[ Muffled ]
BUT I DIDN'T TAKE IT.

00:00:40.097 --> 00:00:43.230
I GOT IT
[Normal voice] IN DIAGON ALLEY,

00:00:43.274 --> 00:00:45.798
AT OLLIVANDER'S,
WHEN I WAS 11.

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:50.455
[ Voice breaking ]
IT CHOSE ME.

00:00:50.498 --> 00:00:53.588
YOU'RE LYING.

00:00:53.632 --> 00:00:55.895
WANDS ONLY CHOOSE
WITCHES,

00:00:55.938 --> 00:00:58.680
AND YOU ARE NOT
A WITCH.

00:00:58.724 --> 00:01:00.813
BUT I AM.

00:01:00.856 --> 00:01:03.903
TELL THEM, REG.
TELL THEM WHAT I AM.

00:01:05.513 --> 00:01:08.125
REG, TELL THEM
WHAT I AM.

00:01:10.997 --> 00:01:13.173
[ LOCKET CONTINUES CLICKING ]

00:01:16.698 --> 00:01:19.919
WHAT ON EARTH
ARE YOU DOING, ALBERT?

00:01:21.834 --> 00:01:24.750
YOU'RE LYING, DOLORES.

00:01:24.793 --> 00:01:28.797
AND ONE
MUSTN'T TELL LIES.

00:01:30.364 --> 00:01:31.757
STUPEFY!

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:34.151
[ GRUNTS ]

00:01:39.373 --> 00:01:40.896
Mary:
OH, IT'S HARRY POTTER.

00:01:40.940 --> 00:01:42.159
YEAH, IT IS,
ISN'T IT?

00:01:42.202 --> 00:01:43.508
THIS'LL BE ONE
TO TELL THE KIDS.

00:01:43.551 --> 00:01:46.337
[ SCREECHING ]

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:52.125
OH!

00:01:54.649 --> 00:01:55.868
[ GRUNTING ]

00:01:55.911 --> 00:01:58.087
[ WHEEZING ]

00:01:59.393 --> 00:02:02.962
EXPECTO PATRONUM!

00:02:03.005 --> 00:02:04.833
[ RATTLING ]

00:02:04.877 --> 00:02:07.793
[ INDISTINCT TALKING ]

00:02:17.585 --> 00:02:19.674
[ ELEVATOR DINGS ]

00:02:23.635 --> 00:02:26.551
[ WHIMPERING ]

00:02:26.594 --> 00:02:29.206
MARY, GO HOME.

00:02:29.249 --> 00:02:31.382
GET THE KIDS.

00:02:31.425 --> 00:02:32.905
I'LL MEET YOU THERE.

00:02:32.948 --> 00:02:35.255
WE HAVE TO GET OUT THE COUNTRY,
UNDERSTAND?

00:02:35.299 --> 00:02:37.039
MARY, DO AS I SAY.

00:02:37.083 --> 00:02:39.085
[ SOBS ]

00:02:42.784 --> 00:02:45.091
[ SOBS ]

00:02:45.134 --> 00:02:47.441
[ ELEVATOR DINGS ]

00:02:47.485 --> 00:02:49.400
[ SIGHS ]

00:02:52.490 --> 00:02:53.839
Reginald: MARY?

00:02:53.882 --> 00:02:55.928
WHO'S THAT?

00:02:55.971 --> 00:02:58.017
[ GASPING ]

00:02:58.060 --> 00:02:59.410
LONG STORY.

00:02:59.453 --> 00:03:00.889
NICE MEETING YOU.

00:03:00.933 --> 00:03:03.065
Man:
IT'S HARRY POTTER.

00:03:03.109 --> 00:03:04.937
IT'S HARRY --
HARRY POTTER.

00:03:04.980 --> 00:03:06.547
Guard #1:
THERE HE IS.

00:03:06.591 --> 00:03:08.114
GET AFTER HIM!
GET HIM!

00:03:08.157 --> 00:03:10.159
[ INDISTINCT SHOUTING ]

00:03:12.161 --> 00:03:14.163
[ GRUNTING ]

00:03:14.207 --> 00:03:15.730
[ SHOUTING CONTINUES ]

00:03:15.774 --> 00:03:17.384
[ GRUNTS ]

00:03:17.428 --> 00:03:19.604
STOP THEM!

00:03:19.647 --> 00:03:21.954
[ INDISTINCT SHOUTING,
SCREAMING ]

00:03:21.997 --> 00:03:23.303
LOOK OUT!
HEY!

00:03:23.347 --> 00:03:25.044
[ SHOUTING CONTINUES ]

00:03:25.087 --> 00:03:26.480
OI!

00:03:35.707 --> 00:03:39.319
AAAH!

00:03:39.363 --> 00:03:40.712
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:03:40.755 --> 00:03:42.191
[ GRUNTS ]

00:03:42.235 --> 00:03:43.845
[ GASPS ]
[ GRUNTS ]

00:03:43.889 --> 00:03:45.804
EXPELLIARMUS!

00:03:47.893 --> 00:03:49.460
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:03:54.421 --> 00:03:56.380
[ WHOOSHING ]

00:04:01.254 --> 00:04:02.864
[ WHOOSHING ]

00:04:02.908 --> 00:04:05.824
[ GRUNTING, SCREAMING ]

00:04:08.174 --> 00:04:10.263
[ CREAKING ]

00:04:14.398 --> 00:04:18.663
[ BIRDS CHIRPING,
LEAVES RUSTLING ]

00:04:21.405 --> 00:04:23.102
[ GRUNTS ]

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:29.021
[ LOCKET CLICKING ]

00:04:29.064 --> 00:04:32.764
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:04:32.807 --> 00:04:34.243
Ron:
[ Panting ] OH, GOD.

00:04:34.287 --> 00:04:36.376
Hermione: SHH, SHH, SHH.
IT'S ALL RIGHT.

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:38.030
IT'S OKAY.[ GROANING AND GRUNTING ]

00:04:38.073 --> 00:04:40.380
SHH. [ SIGHS ]

00:04:40.424 --> 00:04:41.686
HARRY!

00:04:41.729 --> 00:04:43.862
HARRY, QUICKLY,
IN MY BAG.

00:04:43.905 --> 00:04:45.907
THERE'S A BOTTLE LABELED
"ESSENCE OF DITTANY."

00:04:45.951 --> 00:04:48.562
[ GROANING ]

00:04:48.606 --> 00:04:51.391
SHH, SHH.

00:04:51.435 --> 00:04:52.871
[ Panting ]
OKAY, OKAY, OKAY.

00:04:52.914 --> 00:04:54.655
QUICKLY!

00:04:54.699 --> 00:04:56.875
ACCIO DITTANY!

00:04:56.918 --> 00:04:59.094
SHH.
IT'S ALL RIGHT.

00:04:59.138 --> 00:05:00.748
UNSTOPPER IT.

00:05:00.792 --> 00:05:02.402
HERMIONE, HIS ARM.

00:05:02.446 --> 00:05:03.969
I KNOW!
JUST DO IT!

00:05:04.012 --> 00:05:06.014
[ SIGHS ]
IT'S OKAY.

00:05:06.058 --> 00:05:07.320
[ GROANING ][ SOBS ]

00:05:07.364 --> 00:05:09.017
[ Voice breaking ]
OKAY, IT'S GONNA S--

00:05:09.061 --> 00:05:11.063
IT'S GONNA STING
A LITTLE BIT.

00:05:11.106 --> 00:05:13.674
WHAT HAPPENED? I THOUGHT
WE WERE MEANT TO BE GOING
BACK TO GRIMMAULD PLACE.

00:05:13.718 --> 00:05:15.110
WE WERE. WE WERE. SHH.

00:05:15.154 --> 00:05:17.243
IT'S ALL RIGHT.
ONE MORE, ONE MORE.

00:05:17.286 --> 00:05:19.463
WE WERE THERE.
WE WERE THERE. BUT...

00:05:19.506 --> 00:05:21.987
YAXLEY HAD HOLD OF ME, AND I...
[ SIGHS ]

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:24.163
I KNEW ONCE HE'D SEEN
WHERE WE WERE, WE C--

00:05:24.206 --> 00:05:27.906
WE COULDN'T STAY,
SO I BROUGHT US HERE, BUT...

00:05:27.949 --> 00:05:30.648
[Crying]
RON GOT SPLINCHED.

00:05:30.691 --> 00:05:33.738
[ GROANING, GASPING ]

00:05:33.781 --> 00:05:36.741
IT'S ALL RIGHT.

00:05:36.784 --> 00:05:38.438
[ SIGHS ]

00:05:38.482 --> 00:05:40.962
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:05:54.193 --> 00:05:55.455
[ SIGHS ]

00:05:55.499 --> 00:05:57.065
PROTEGO TOTALUM.

00:05:57.109 --> 00:05:58.893
[ BREATHING SHAKILY ]

00:05:58.937 --> 00:06:00.678
SALVIO HEXIA.

00:06:00.721 --> 00:06:02.375
[ Muffled ]
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

00:06:02.419 --> 00:06:04.246
[ Muffled ]
PROTECTIVE ENCHANTMENTS.

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:05.857
I DON'T FANCY
ANOTHER VISIT

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:08.163
LIKE THE ONE WE HAD
IN SHAFTESBURY AVENUE, DO YOU?

00:06:08.207 --> 00:06:10.470
YOU CAN GET GOING
ON THE TENT.

00:06:10.514 --> 00:06:12.951
[ Normal voice ] TENT?[ Normal voice ]
PROTEGO TOTALUM.

00:06:12.994 --> 00:06:15.432
WHERE AM I SUPPOSED TO FIND
A TENT?

00:06:15.475 --> 00:06:17.477
REPELLO MUGGLETUM.

00:06:17.521 --> 00:06:19.653
MUFFLIATO.

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:31.448
YOU FIRST.

00:06:32.187 --> 00:06:34.407
[ LOCKET CLICKING ]

00:06:34.451 --> 00:06:35.669
DISSENDIUM!

00:06:39.717 --> 00:06:43.721
[ CLICKING CONTINUES ]

00:06:50.075 --> 00:06:51.337
INCENDIO!

00:06:55.036 --> 00:06:57.517
[ CLICKING CONTINUES ]

00:06:57.561 --> 00:06:59.476
EXPULSO!

00:07:05.525 --> 00:07:07.745
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]
DIFFINDO!

00:07:07.788 --> 00:07:10.051
[ CLICKING CONTINUES ]

00:07:10.095 --> 00:07:11.749
REDUCTO!

00:07:16.754 --> 00:07:19.408
[ CLICKING CONTINUES ]

00:07:19.452 --> 00:07:21.976
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

